                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "45915662",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198030765814",
                            "num_reviews": 6,
                            "playtime_forever": 37,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 37,
                            "last_played": 1542859386
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Oh man. It's back! Original Quivr was pretty much one of the only worthwhile games when Vive first released. No matter what else I decided to do when I put on the headset I knew I could jump into Quivr for a good time, and it held up great over time. I was very sad to see it be replaced by what was really a completely different game. I installed this yesterday, and hell yeah. Original Quivr is back, and better now. All the new art and lessons learned from the original project incorporated makes this even better. If you get any enjoyment whatsoever out of shooting a bow in VR, this is the game to have. Thanks Blueteak for bringing this back!  \n\nThe only thing I personally would like to see is better instructions or simple tutorials for how to use the various gear upgrades you get. Even with the diagrams, how to use some things are not obvious.",
